# apps/web/e2e stays: `next build` type-checks playwright.config.ts, which imports it.
# Keeps the build context to what the build reads, and keeps a host's
# node_modules (wrong platform) and .next out of the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
.agents
.github
.design-sync
.turbo
.vercel
.playwright-mcp
.auth
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
docs
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.DS_Store
